<view class="legal-page">
  <view class="legal-h1">隐私政策</view>
  <view class="legal-meta">运营主体 {{operator}} · {{contact}}</view>
  <text class="legal-body">{{privacyFull}}</text>

  <view class="legal-h2">用户协议</view>
  <text class="legal-body">{{terms}}</text>

  <view class="legal-h2">授权管理</view>
  <view class="legal-hint">可撤回您已授予的处理范围。未登录或未授权项显示为未授权。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loadingScopes}}" class="legal-hint">加载授权状态…</view>
  <view
    wx:for="{{scopes}}"
    wx:key="scope"
    class="scope-row"
  >
    <view class="scope-meta">
      <text class="scope-label">{{item.label}}</text>
      <text class="scope-state">{{item.granted ? '已授权' : '未授权'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view
      wx:if="{{item.granted}}"
      class="scope-btn"
      data-scope="{{item.scope}}"
      bindtap="handleRevoke"
    >撤回</view>
  </view>

  <view class="legal-h2">账号注销</view>
  <view class="legal-hint">
    注销后将匿名化邮箱、openid 等标识信息；审计日志按法规留存。当前可完成本机退出并邮件申请服务端注销。
  </view>
  <view class="danger-btn" bindtap="handleDeleteAccount">申请注销账号</view>
  <view class="link-btn" bindtap="handleCopyContact">复制运营联系邮箱</view>
</view>
